 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Model Prediction Analysis for Arrythmia and Heart Damage of Cadiac Organoids\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook trains XGBoost models using **only** the PK-PD elimination equation coefficients to predict:\n",
    "- **Arrhythmia** (binary: true/false)\n",
    "- **Heart Damage** (binary: true/false)  \n",
    "- **Concern** (multiclass: most/less/no)\n",
    "\n",
    "Each step is shown in separate cells so you can validate the data as we go.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Installation Instructions\n",
    "\n",
    "**If you get import errors, run the cell below to install all required packages.**\n",
    "\n",
    "Alternatively, you can install from the command line:\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "pip install pandas numpy scikit-learn xgboost joblib openpyxl matplotlib ipykernel jupyter\n",
    "```\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
