    "## Step 5: Preprocess Targets\n",
    "\n",
    "Convert target columns to numeric format:\n",
    "- Arrhythmia/Heart Damage: 'true'/'false' → 1/0\n",
    "- Concern: 'most'/'less'/'no' → 2/1/0\n"
   ]
  },
